    "camera_framing_composition": "Crop, shot distance, body framing, panel arrangement, or spatial composition of the image.",
    "character_count": "The number, gender grouping, or broad multiplicity of characters present.",
    "character_name": "Danbooru character identity tags; assigned from Danbooru metadata, not by the language model.",
